{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:164546a9c5481480","name":"Withdraw","source":{"id":"source:reference-164546a9c5481480","title":"Withdraw","revision":18615,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:25:21Z","sha256":"217ca53077d42dd8e2d3070cc987c70bf0ff850204ec4cd534255962033cf02e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18615","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Withdraw&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-164546a9c5481480","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can Withdraw from combat as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},". To Withdraw, the first 1 square of your movement must take you out of your opponent's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threatened Area"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threatened_Area"}," by the shortest possible route. If you must move more than 1 square to escape the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threatened Area"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threatened_Area"},", you can't Withdraw. You can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," normally in order to escape an opponent, but you provoke an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," when doing so.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once you clear the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threatened Area"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threatened_Area"},", you may continue to move, up to a total of half your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},". You can Withdraw from more than one opponent in the same Action, but only if you can clear all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threatened Areas"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threatened_Areas"}," in your first 1 square of movement.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Withdrawing protects you from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," during your first square of movement, but you may provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"}," later in your turn (for example, you may move through another character's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threatened Area"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threatened_Area"},").\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
